<rml>
<head>
    <title>Forge UI — компоненты</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="../forge-ui/base.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="../forge-ui/typography.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="../forge-ui/actions.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="../forge-ui/containers.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="../forge-ui/menus.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="../forge-ui/hud.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="../forge-ui/inventory.rcss"/>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="gallery.rcss"/>
</head>
<body data-model="gallery">
    <div class="topbar row gap-4">
        <div class="headline-small">Forge UI</div>
        <div class="muted body-medium grow">Все компоненты дизайн-системы. Правьте файлы в ui/ — окно обновится само.</div>
        <div class="row gap-2">
            <div class="chip" data-class-selected="theme == 'dark'" data-event-click="set_theme('dark')"><icon name="dark_mode"/>Тёмная</div>
            <div class="chip" data-class-selected="theme == 'light'" data-event-click="set_theme('light')"><icon name="light_mode"/>Светлая</div>
            <div class="chip" data-class-selected="theme == 'fantasy'" data-event-click="set_theme('fantasy')"><icon name="castle"/>Фэнтези</div>
            <div class="chip" data-class-selected="theme == 'parchment'" data-event-click="set_theme('parchment')"><icon name="history_edu"/>Пергамент</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="columns row">
        <div class="column gap-4 col">
            <div class="panel elevated">
                <div class="panel-header"><icon name="touch_app" class="s"/><span class="title">Кнопки</span></div>
                <div class="panel-body column gap-3">
                    <div class="row gap-2">
                        <div class="button filled" data-event-click="count_click"><icon name="play_arrow"/>Играть</div>
                        <div class="button tonal"><icon name="save"/>Сохранить</div>
                        <div class="button outlined">Отмена</div>
                        <div class="button text">Ещё</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row gap-2">
                        <div class="button elevated small"><icon name="add"/>Добавить</div>
                        <div class="button danger small"><icon name="delete"/>Удалить</div>
                        <div class="button filled small disabled">Недоступно</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row gap-1">
                        <div class="icon-button"><icon name="undo"/></div>
                        <div class="icon-button"><icon name="redo"/></div>
                        <div class="icon-button selected"><icon name="grid_on"/></div>
                        <div class="icon-button tonal"><icon name="tune"/></div>
                        <div class="icon-button filled"><icon name="bolt"/></div>
                        <div class="icon-button outlined"><icon name="settings"/></div>
                        <span class="muted grow" style="margin-left: 8px;">Нажатий: {{ clicks }}</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row gap-2 body-small muted">
                        <span class="key-hint">Ctrl</span><span class="key-hint">Z</span><span>отменить</span>
                        <span class="key-hint">F5</span><span>играть</span>
                        <span class="key-hint">E</span><span>взаимодействие</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="panel elevated">
                <div class="panel-header"><icon name="tune" class="s"/><span class="title">Меню и настройки</span></div>
                <div class="panel-body row gap-4">
                    <div class="menu-list menu">
                        <div class="menu-item selected"><icon name="play_circle"/><span class="label">Продолжить</span></div>
                        <div class="menu-item"><icon name="add_circle"/><span class="label">Новая игра</span></div>
                        <div class="menu-item"><icon name="settings"/><span class="label">Настройки</span><span class="trailing">F2</span></div>
                        <div class="menu-item disabled"><icon name="cloud"/><span class="label">Облако</span></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="column gap-3 grow">
                        <div class="row gap-3"><span class="label-large setting">Громкость</span><input type="range" min="0" max="100" step="1" data-value="volume"/><span class="mono">{{ volume }}</span></div>
                        <div class="row gap-3"><span class="label-large setting">Музыка</span>
                            <div class="switch" data-class-on="music" data-event-click="music = !music"><div class="thumb"/></div></div>
                        <div class="row gap-3"><span class="label-large setting">Качество</span>
                            <div class="cycler"><div class="icon-button small" data-event-click="cycle(-1)"><icon name="chevron_left"/></div><span class="value">{{ quality }}</span><div class="icon-button small" data-event-click="cycle(1)"><icon name="chevron_right"/></div></div></div>
                        <div class="row gap-3"><span class="label-large setting">Имя</span><input type="text" class="grow" data-value="name"/></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="column gap-4 col">
            <div class="panel elevated">
                <div class="panel-header"><icon name="favorite" class="s"/><span class="title">HUD</span></div>
                <div class="panel-body column gap-3">
                    <div class="row gap-3"><icon name="favorite" class="s health-icon"/><div class="resource-bar grow"><div class="trail" style="width: 82%;"/><div class="fill" data-style-width="health + '%'"/></div><span class="hud-numeral small-numeral">{{ health }}</span></div>
                    <div class="row gap-3"><icon name="water_drop" class="s mana-icon"/><div class="resource-bar mana grow"><div class="fill" style="width: 45%;"/></div><span class="hud-numeral small-numeral">45</span></div>
                    <div class="row gap-3"><icon name="bolt" class="s stamina-icon"/><div class="resource-bar stamina small grow"><div class="fill" style="width: 90%;"/></div></div>
                    <div class="row gap-3">
                        <div class="ability-slot ready"><icon name="swords"/><span class="key-hint">1</span></div>
                        <div class="ability-slot"><icon name="shield"/><div class="cooldown" style="height: 60%;"/><span class="key-hint">2</span></div>
                        <div class="ability-slot"><icon name="local_fire_department"/><span class="key-hint">3</span></div>
                        <div class="toast grow"><icon name="emoji_events"/><div><div class="overline">Достижение</div><div>Первый шаг сделан</div></div></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="panel elevated">
                <div class="panel-header"><icon name="backpack" class="s"/><span class="title">Инвентарь</span><span class="badge">Новое</span></div>
                <div class="panel-body row gap-4">
                    <div class="slot-grid inventory">
                        <div class="item-slot rarity-common"><icon name="hardware"/><span class="count">3</span></div>
                        <div class="item-slot rarity-uncommon"><icon name="eco"/><span class="count">12</span></div>
                        <div class="item-slot rarity-rare selected"><icon name="diamond"/></div>
                        <div class="item-slot rarity-epic"><icon name="auto_awesome"/></div>
                        <div class="item-slot rarity-legendary"><icon name="swords"/></div>
                        <div class="item-slot rarity-mythic"><icon name="local_fire_department"/></div>
                        <div class="item-slot"/>
                        <div class="item-slot"/>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item-tooltip">
                        <div class="name rarity-rare">Сапфир бури</div>
                        <div class="body-small muted">Редкий · Камень</div>
                        <div class="stats">Урон молнией <span class="better">+12 ▲</span><br/>Вес <span class="worse">0.4 ▼</span></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="dialogue-box">
                <div class="speaker">Кузнец Борин</div>
                <div class="line">Принеси мне три слитка железа — и я выкую тебе клинок, достойный героя.</div>
                <div class="choices row gap-2"><div class="button tonal small">Договорились</div><div class="button text small">Позже</div></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel elevated col list-panel column">
            <div class="panel-header"><icon name="account_tree" class="s"/><span class="title">{{ rows }} строк</span><span class="muted body-small">виртуальный список</span></div>
            <virtual-list id="rows" source="demo-rows" class="grow">
                <div class="list-row" vl-class-selected="selected" vl-style-padding-left="indent">
                    <icon class="s" vl-attr-name="icon"/>
                    <span class="name" vl-text="name"/>
                    <span class="kind" vl-text="kind"/>
                </div>
            </virtual-list>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</rml>
